data: {"id": "ba16605b08b144c2-thinking-parallel_evidence-358", "run_id": "ba16605b08b144c2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "关键发现：\n1. Pod **仍在 cluster 中**（非 NotFound）\n2. `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-11T03:47:07Z`\n3. `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`\n4. **finalizers: `aiops.lab/hold`** ← 这是核心\n5. `phase: Running`（但 containers 都是 Terminated）\n6. 容器 exit code 137 (SIGKILL)\n7. `status: Terminating (lasts 92m)` — 已经卡了 92 分钟\n8. `terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 10`\n\n这是一个典型的 finalizer 导致的 TerminatingStuck。`deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0` 说明删除请求是强制的，但 `aiops.lab/hold` finalizer 阻止了对象被 GC 删除。\n\n让我补充检查节点的 Ready 状态（虽然从 Pod 来看不太像节点问题，但需排除", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789103969258, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

